		"description": "<p>Severing yourself from your own shadow, you place it at your opponent’s back! Until the start of your next turn, your shadow occupies a space within 15ft of you as if it were a living thing which threatens a 5ft area. If a cursed target provokes an opportunity attack from your shadow, you may make an opportunity attack against that target.</p>",
